      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "居然能阻止失控超级好胜毛蟹\n之间的失控超级蟹斗，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你……不是一般人啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C45713680FD963B6B62593163A78D857EA7597D80DC6BDB87F9000A4E4B95F47684593163A78D857EA787F96597FF0C00100001BE00000A4F60202620264E0D662F4E00822C4EBA554AFF0100100002011401D90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那是……\n好胜毛蟹进化石。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
