      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "据说好胜毛蟹有着争当第一和\n殴打眼前目标的习性。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
